{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19741","headline":"风咏 · 吕温","name":"风咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微风生青苹，习习出金塘。\n轻摇深林翠，静猎幽径芳。\n掩抑时未来，鸿毛亦无伤。\n一朝乘严气，万里号清霜。\n北走摧邓林，东去落扶桑。\n扫却垂天云，澄清无私光。\n悠然返空寂，晏海通舟航。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19741.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19741","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}